          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತಲೆಮಾರು — talemāru — \"a family generation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಈ ಮನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ನಾಲ್ಕು ತಲೆಮಾರಿನವರು ಒಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಇದ್ದರು. ī maneyalli nālku talemārinavaru oṭṭige iddaru. Four generations lived together in this house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ತಲೆಮಾರುಗಳು, talemārugaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Grandparents, parents and children are three ತಲೆಮಾರು (talemāru)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತಲೆಮಾರು (talemāru) is built on native tale, \"head, top\" (DEDR 3103); the origin of the second part, -ಮಾರು, is not settled."
            }
